      children: ["\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "Watch your cravings today and name them \"buds\" — every unfulfilled desire is a promise, and naming it loosens its hold on you."
      }), "\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "Practice one act of asanga daily: do something for someone with no return expected. That is the axe in miniature."
      }), "\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "When you move to a new place or role, notice what you carried with you — the inner fragrance proves the law of transfer; change the flower, not the city."
      }), "\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "During a meal, pause once and sense the Vaisvanara: the same fire that digests you is the fire that lights the sun. Eat with that awareness and eating becomes worship."
      }), "\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "When pride rises, remember it is the first root of the tree (15.5); the deepest cut begins with the ego."
      }), "\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "Rest in the distinction: thoughts change (kshara), awareness is constant (akshara), and there is something that watches both — Purushottama. End each day by watching the watcher for one minute."
      }), "\n", (0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_components.li, {
        children: "Close your day with one line of surrender: \"I take refuge in the primeval Person\" (15.4) — refuge is not submission; it is remembering where you come from."
      }), "\n"]
